# Repo-wide line-ending policy.
#
# WHY: Several files in this repo are SHA-pinned (e.g. workloads/prompts.jsonl,
# per-cell inferences.jsonl). Without explicit line-ending rules, Windows
# checkouts with the default core.autocrlf=true would convert LF→CRLF on
# checkout, breaking the published SHA256 and making sha256sum --check fail
# for reproducers on Windows.
#
# These rules force LF on every platform for line-based text formats, and pin
# the SHA-anchored corpus files as `binary` (no transformation, ever).

# Text formats — force LF on checkout regardless of platform.
*.md         text eol=lf
*.yaml       text eol=lf
*.yml        text eol=lf
*.json       text eol=lf
*.csv        text eol=lf
*.tsv        text eol=lf
*.sh         text eol=lf
*.py         text eol=lf
*.ts         text eol=lf
*.js         text eol=lf
*.mjs        text eol=lf
*.sha256     text eol=lf

# JSONL: data files where byte-identity matters. We pin as `binary` (rather
# than `text eol=lf`) so SHAs match across platforms without depending on
# git's autocrlf settings being correct on the reproducer's side.
.gitattributes text eol=lf
*.jsonl      binary

# Generated/raw artifacts — also pin as binary.
*.log        binary
power.csv    binary
thermals.csv binary
gpu-nvml-clock.csv binary
*.gz         binary

# Frozen offline fixture corpus for p3_market (binary/generated fixture policy).
#
# WHY: every byte under tooling/fixtures/p3_market/ is pinned by sha256 in
# benchmarks/qwen36-vs-qwen38-corrective-2026-08/manifest/pins-2026-08-16.json
# (key: fixtures_p3_market) and re-checked by the fixture determinism gate.
# These are captured web snapshots: whitespace-hygiene checks (git diff --check
# trailing-whitespace/CR scanning) and text/EOL transformation MUST NOT apply.
# Any byte change must surface as a sha256 mismatch against the manifest, never
# be normalized or "fixed" by git or lint tooling. Hash-preserving: -text means
# no conversion in either direction, so checked-out bytes equal committed bytes
# on every platform.
tooling/fixtures/p3_market/** -diff -text
